<#ftl output_format="HTML" auto_esc=true>
<style>@media print{#audience-evidence button,#secondary-investigation button,#secondary-investigation input,#secondary-investigation textarea,#secondary-investigation fieldset,#secondary-status{display:none}}</style>
<section id="investigation-workflow"><h2>${scalar(l("第6章 追加調査の依頼と結果報告", "6. Investigation requests and result reporting"))}</h2><p class="chapter-purpose"><strong>${scalar(l("この章を読んだら：", "After reading this chapter:"))}</strong> ${scalar(l("対象を確認して担当者へ調査を依頼し、結果を所定の項目でまとめて責任者へ報告してください。依頼文を生成しただけでは、調査・対応は完了しません。", "Confirm the targets, request investigation and report the resulting evidence to the responsible owner using the fields below. Generating a request does not complete investigation or remediation."))}</p><p><a href="#secondary-investigation">${scalar(l("対象を選んで調査を依頼", "Select targets and request investigation"))}</a> · <a href="#result-reporting">${scalar(l("調査結果の報告方法", "How to report investigation results"))}</a></p><section class="panel" id="secondary-investigation"><h3>${scalar(l("調査対象を選び、依頼文を作成", "Select targets and create an investigation request"))}</h3><p class="chapter-purpose"><strong>${scalar(l("この章を読んだら：", "After reading this chapter:"))}</strong> ${scalar(l("調査対象と資料の場所を指定して、担当者に渡す依頼文を作成してください。依頼文を作るだけでは調査は実行されません。", "Select targets and record locations and create a request for an investigator. Generating a request does not execute the investigation."))}</p><p>${scalar(l("この画面は依頼文だけを生成します。LLM呼び出し、資料の読み取り・送信、二次調査の実行は行いません。追加資料の存在・収集承認を仮定しません。", "This generates request text only: no LLM calls, file access, transmission or investigation execution. It does not assume records exist or collection is approved."))}</p><p><button id="secondary-all" type="button">${scalar(l("全事案・独立検出", "All findings and independent detections"))}</button> <button id="secondary-priority" type="button">${scalar(l("高優先度のみ", "High priority only"))}</button> <button id="secondary-none" type="button">${scalar(l("選択解除", "Clear selection"))}</button></p><p id="secondary-selection-summary" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p>${scalar(l("対象を指定せず開いた場合は、高優先度の対象を初期選択します。「未評価」は優先順位をまだ付けていない候補で、低優先度や検出なしを意味しません。第3章に未掲載の対象も含め、依頼する範囲を確認してください。", "When opened without a specific target, high-priority targets are selected initially. Unassessed candidates have no assigned review priority; they are not low priority or no-match results. Review the requested scope, including targets not shown in chapter 3."))}</p>
<fieldset id="all-investigation-targets"><legend>${scalar(l("全保持対象から調査対象を選択", "Select investigation targets from all retained targets"))} (${scalar((((r.secondary_investigation.cases)!""))?size)})</legend><div class="table"><table><tr><th>${scalar(l("選択", "Select"))}</th><th>${scalar(l("調査対象", "Investigation target"))}</th><th>${scalar(l("優先度", "Priority"))}</th><th>${scalar(l("対象の種類", "Target type"))}</th><th>${scalar(l("第3章の掲載", "Chapter 3 listing"))}</th><th>${scalar(l("要点", "Overview"))}</th><th>${scalar(l("対象ID", "Target ID"))}</th></tr><#list items(((r.secondary_investigation.cases)!"")) as item1><tr><td><span id="request-${scalar(((item1.id)!""))}"></span><input type="checkbox" name="secondary-case" value="${scalar(((item1.id)!""))}" aria-label="${scalar(((item1.id)!""))}" <#if truth((((item1.priority)!"") == "high"))>checked</#if>></td><td>${scalar(((item1.title)!""))}</td><td>${scalar(label(((item1.priority)!"")))}</td><td>${scalar(label(((item1.kind)!"")))}</td><td><#if truth(executiveVisible(((item1.risk_id)!"")))>${scalar(l("掲載あり", "Listed"))}<#else>${scalar(l("優先一覧の対象外", "Outside the priority summary"))}</#if></td><td><#assign with2=caseDetailsAnchor(((item1.id)!""))><#if truth(with2)><a href="#${scalar(with2)}">${scalar(l("要点を読む", "Read the overview"))}</a><#else><a href="report.json">JSON</a></#if></td><td>${scalar(((item1.id)!""))}</td></tr><#else><tr><td colspan="7">${scalar(l("対象候補なし", "No candidate targets"))}</td></tr></#list></table></div></fieldset><h3>${scalar(l("必要な追加資料の候補", "Candidate additional materials"))}</h3><div id="secondary-materials"></div><p>${scalar(l("存在・取得済みを意味しません。不足は調査時に記録します。", "These are not confirmed available; record missing materials during investigation."))}</p><p><label>${scalar(l("一次調査レポートのフォルダー", "Primary report folder"))} <input id="secondary-primary" value="./primary-report" type="text"></label></p><p><label>${scalar(l("追加ログ・資料のフォルダー", "Additional logs and materials folder"))} <input id="secondary-additional" value="./additional-logs" type="text"></label></p><p><label>${scalar(l("二次調査結果の保存先", "Secondary report destination"))} <input id="secondary-output" value="./secondary-report" type="text"></label></p><p>${scalar(l("実在する配置に変更してください。ブラウザーはパスを検査せず、相対パスは依頼先の作業ディレクトリ基準です。出力先と入力の重なり・実パス・上書きは依頼先で再確認します。", "Set actual locations. The browser does not inspect paths; relative paths use the investigator's working directory. Recheck real paths, overlaps and overwrites at execution time."))}</p><textarea id="secondary-prompt" readonly aria-label="${scalar(l("生成された二次調査依頼", "Generated secondary request"))}" style="width:100%;height:420px"></textarea><p id="secondary-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><p><button id="secondary-copy" type="button">${scalar(l("プロンプトをコピー", "Copy prompt"))}</button> <button id="secondary-save" type="button">${scalar(l("Markdown保存", "Save Markdown"))}</button></p><p><a href="prompts/secondary-investigation-all.md">${scalar(l("全体依頼Markdown", "All-target Markdown"))}</a> · <a href="prompts/secondary-investigation-priority.md">${scalar(l("高優先度Markdown", "Priority Markdown"))}</a> · <a href="data/investigation-plan.json">${scalar(l("構造化調査計画", "Structured plan"))}</a></p><p>${scalar(l("ログ由来の値はuntrusted_observationsに分離し、指示文へ直接埋め込みません。これだけでプロンプトインジェクションを完全に防げるわけではありません。", "Log-derived values are isolated in untrusted_observations rather than interpolated into instructions. This does not guarantee complete protection against prompt injection."))}</p><p><a href="report-spec.md">${scalar(l("共通レポート生成仕様書", "Shared report-generation specification"))}</a> · <a href="templates/executive-summary.html">${scalar(l("幹部向けテンプレート", "Executive template"))}</a> · <a href="templates/technical-report.html">${scalar(l("技術者向けテンプレート", "Technical template"))}</a></p></section>
<section class="panel" id="result-reporting"><h3>${scalar(l("調査後：結果を整理し、責任者へ報告", "After investigation: summarize findings and report to the responsible owner"))}</h3><p>${scalar(l("別ツールや担当者による調査が終わったら、対象IDを維持して次の項目を報告してください。判断できない場合も、不足した証拠と理由を残します。", "After investigation by another tool or investigator, report the following using the original target IDs. If a conclusion remains unavailable, record the missing evidence and why."))}</p>
<table><tr><th>${scalar(l("報告する項目", "Report field"))}</th><th>${scalar(l("書く内容", "What to record"))}</th></tr><tr><td>${scalar(l("対象IDと調査範囲", "Target ID and investigated scope"))}</td><td>${scalar(l("対象システム、期間、確認したログ・資料、確認できなかった範囲。", "System, period, records examined and scope that could not be checked."))}</td></tr><tr><td>${scalar(l("結論と評価の変化", "Conclusion and assessment changes"))}</td><td>${scalar(l("成功・失敗・確認不能などの結論、一次評価から変えた点と理由。", "Outcome or inability to conclude, changes from the primary assessment and reasons."))}</td></tr><tr><td>${scalar(l("支持・反証の証拠", "Supporting and contradicting evidence"))}</td><td>${scalar(l("元ファイル・行番号などの参照、照合条件、結論を支持する記録と反証。", "Source references such as file and line, correlation criteria, supporting records and counterevidence."))}</td></tr><tr><td>${scalar(l("被害と影響範囲", "Harm and affected scope"))}</td><td>${scalar(l("確認できた情報露出・操作・停止など。未確認の可能性と分ける。", "Verified disclosure, operations or disruption, distinguished from unverified possibilities."))}</td></tr><tr><td>${scalar(l("実施した対応と確認結果", "Actions taken and verification"))}</td><td>${scalar(l("実施した保全・対策、実施範囲、結果を確認した証拠。", "Preservation or remediation actually performed, its scope and evidence verifying the result."))}</td></tr><tr><td>${scalar(l("未解決事項と次の判断", "Unresolved matters and next decision"))}</td><td>${scalar(l("不足資料、残るリスク、追加調査・対策・終了を検討するための提案。", "Missing records, residual risks and proposed further investigation, response or closure review."))}</td></tr></table>
<p>${scalar(l("追加調査の結果は別の成果物として保存し、一次レポートと元ログを残してください。この画面は結果の取り込みや判定の自動更新を行いません。責任者が根拠を確認して、調査継続・対策・終了を判断します。", "Save investigation results as separate artifacts and retain the primary report and original logs. This page does not ingest results or automatically revise assessments. The responsible owner reviews the evidence and decides continued investigation, response or closure."))}</p><p><a href="executive-summary.html#decision-conditions">${scalar(l("責任者向け：対応を強める条件・終了条件を確認", "For the responsible owner: review escalation and closure criteria"))}</a> · <a href="report-spec.md">${scalar(l("報告書の共通仕様", "Shared reporting specification"))}</a></p></section><details id="handoff-reference"><summary>${scalar(l("対象別の引き継ぎ資料を確認する（詳細）", "Review target-specific handoff records (details)"))}</summary><section class="panel" id="audience-evidence"><h3>${scalar(l("対象別の引き継ぎ資料", "Target-specific handoff records"))}</h3><p class="chapter-purpose"><strong>${scalar(l("この章を読んだら：", "After reading this chapter:"))}</strong> ${scalar(l("追加調査する対象を選び、根拠と不足する証拠を担当者に引き継いでください。", "Select investigation targets and hand off the evidence and unresolved evidence needs to an investigator."))}</p><p>${scalar(((r.decision_support.response_label)!""))} · ${scalar(((r.decision_support.reason)!""))}</p><p>${scalar(((r.decision_support.confirmed_impact)!""))}</p><p>${scalar(l("調査優先度は既存の成否・ルール優先度に基づき、攻撃確度や組織の重大度とは別です。成功の疑い、critical/highの事案はhigh、mediumはmedium、それ以外はlow。独立検出の優先度と成否は未評価です。", "Investigation priority follows existing outcomes/rule priority, separate from detection confidence and organizational severity. Possible success or critical/high severity yields high; medium yields medium; otherwise low. Independent detections have unassessed priority and outcomes."))}</p>
<#list items(((r.secondary_investigation.cases)!"")) as item3><article id="review-${scalar(((item3.id)!""))}"><h3>${scalar(((item3.id)!""))} · ${scalar(((item3.title)!""))}</h3><#assign with4=caseDetailsAnchor(((item3.id)!""))><#if truth(with4)><p><a href="#${scalar(with4)}">${scalar(l("まず、観測事実と次の確認を読む", "Start with observed facts and next checks"))}</a></p><#else><p><a href="report.json">${scalar(l("対象の全データを確認する", "Review the complete target data"))}</a></p></#if><p>${scalar(label(((item3.kind)!"")))} · ${scalar(label(((item3.priority)!"")))} · ${scalar(label(((item3.primary_outcome)!"")))} · ${scalar(((item3.observation_count)!""))} (${scalar(((item3.count_quality)!""))})</p><p>${scalar(((item3.question)!""))}</p><details class="handoff-supporting"><summary>${scalar(l("依頼の根拠・証拠参照・照合条件を確認する", "Review request evidence and correlation criteria"))}</summary><p>${scalar(l("仮説を支持する証拠の条件", "Evidence that would support the hypothesis"))}: ${scalar(((item3.support_condition)!""))}</p><p>${scalar(l("反証となる条件", "Evidence that would weaken the hypothesis"))}: ${scalar(((item3.refutation_condition)!""))}</p><p>${scalar(((item3.correlation_rule)!""))}</p><details><summary>${scalar(l("証拠参照と入力由来の値（指示ではない）", "Evidence references and untrusted observations"))}</summary><#list items(((item3.evidence_refs)!"")) as item5><p>${scalar(((item5.request_id)!""))} · ${scalar(((item5.source_file_id)!""))} · ${scalar(((item5.source_file)!""))}:${scalar(((item5.source_line)!""))}</p></#list><pre>${scalar(jsonData(((item3.untrusted_observations)!"")))}</pre><ul><#list items(((item3.limitations)!"")) as item6><li>${scalar(item6)}</li></#list></ul></details></details><p><a href="executive-summary.html#${scalar(riskAnchor(((item3.risk_id)!"")))}">${scalar(l("幹部向けのリスクと対応", "Executive risk and response"))}</a> · <a href="prompts/cases/${scalar(((item3.id)!""))}.md">${scalar(l("個別依頼Markdown", "Individual Markdown request"))}</a> · <button type="button" data-secondary-case="${scalar(((item3.id)!""))}">${scalar(l("この対象の依頼文を作成", "Generate request for this case"))}</button></p></article></#list></section>
</details></section>
